      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "I wanted to call you Monday evening. But the first thing I knew it was so late that I was ashamed to call and the follow- ing ev. you were up to George's. I sure was pleased the your Mother so evidently enjoyed the trip and the little visit. I went out a couple of times after dark that night to find it not dark at all but beautiful moon-light. I was confident that you were having a pleasant moon-light return to Muskegon. Thanks be to God. ..... I was not surprized that you all liked the photo It always brings back to my mind a really beautiful and touch- celebration; and thanks be to God again the first half of the 16 to cross the border into eternity, have gone beautifully, in peace ..... Now Miss Doris: I would sure appreciate it if you would send that photo to Father M. Joachim Casey (my Brother to whom it belongs as I think I told you. Please God I'll let you know about the Chapter as soon as we learn the results, etc.",
      "per_polygon": "I wanted to call you Monday evening. But the first thing I knew it was so late that I was ashamed to call and the follow- ing ev. you were up to George's. I sure was pleased the your Mother so evidently enjoyed the trip and the little visit. I went out a couple of times after dark that night to find it not dark at all but beautiful moon-light. I was confident that you were having a pleasant moon-light return to Muskegon. Thanks be to God. ... . I was not surprized that you all liked the photo It always brings back to my mind a really beautiful and touch- celebration; and thanks be to God again the first half of the 16 to cross the border into eternity, have gone beautifully, in peace. Now Miss Doris: I would sure appreciate it if you would send that photo to Father M. Joachim Casey (my Brother to whom it belongs as I think I told you. Please God I'll let you know about the Chapter as soon as we learn the results, etc.",
